      "source_quote": "鈞體羸多疾，閉閤臥治，而百姓化其德，劫盜皆奔出境。",
      "reading": "臨川內史鈞體弱臥治，傳載劫盜出境。數位閉閤，殿本閉閣。",
      "note": "臨川內史鈞體弱臥治，傳載劫盜出境。數位閉閤，殿本閉閣。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 25,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-25",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "嘗禽劫帥，不加考掠，但和言誚責。",
      "reading": "傳稱捕得劫帥，鈞以和言誚責。",
      "note": "傳稱捕得劫帥，鈞以和言誚責。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 25,
      "end_codepoint": 41,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-41",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "劫帥稽顙乞改過，鈞便命遣之，後遂爲善人。",
      "reading": "劫帥乞改，鈞釋之，傳稱後為善人。",
      "note": "劫帥乞改，鈞釋之，傳稱後為善人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 41,
      "end_codepoint": 61,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-61",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "郡舊多山瘧，更暑必動，自鈞在任，郡境無復瘧疾。",
      "reading": "郡有山瘧。任內無復瘧疾為本傳敘述。",
      "note": "郡有山瘧。任內無復瘧疾為本傳敘述。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 61,
      "end_codepoint": 84,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-84",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "母憂去職，居喪過禮，昭明太子憂之，手書誡喻曰：「知比諸德，哀頓爲過，又所進殆無一溢，甚以酸耿。",
      "reading": "母喪去職，昭明太子手令勸其進食。",
      "note": "母喪去職，昭明太子手令勸其進食。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 84,
      "end_codepoint": 131,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-131",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "迥然一身，宗奠是寄，毀而滅性，聖教所不許。",
      "reading": "太子以一身繫宗奠勸勿過哀。數位迥然，殿本迴然並有考證疑字。",
      "note": "太子以一身繫宗奠勸勿過哀。數位迥然，殿本迴然並有考證疑字。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 131,
      "end_codepoint": 152,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
