      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "宜微自遣割，俯存禮制，穀粥果蔬，少加勉強。",
      "reading": "勸鈞稍進食，數位穀粥，殿本饘粥。",
      "note": "勸鈞稍進食，數位穀粥，殿本饘粥。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 152,
      "end_codepoint": 173,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-173",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "憂懷旣深，指故有及，並令繆道臻口具。」",
      "reading": "命繆道臻口頭詳告，手令至此。",
      "note": "命繆道臻口頭詳告，手令至此。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 173,
      "end_codepoint": 192,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
