      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "鈞答曰：「奉賜手令，並繆道臻宣旨，伏讀感咽，肝心塗地。",
      "reading": "殷鈞覆太子，謝領手令與口旨。",
      "note": "殷鈞覆太子，謝領手令與口旨。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 192,
      "end_codepoint": 219,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-219",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "小人無情，動不及禮，但稟生尫劣，假推年歲，罪戾所鐘，復加橫疾。",
      "reading": "鈞自言羸病，稱小人。",
      "note": "鈞自言羸病，稱小人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 219,
      "end_codepoint": 250,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:received_sentence3-250",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "頃者綿微，守盡晷漏，目亂玄黃，心迷哀樂，惟救危苦，未能以遠理自製。",
      "reading": "鈞陳病中耳目心神。",
      "note": "鈞陳病中耳目心神。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 250,
      "end_codepoint": 283,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
