      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ceq_pnr_q0e_A",
      "source_quote": "姜桂之滋，實聞前典，不避粱肉，復忝今慈，臣亦何人，降此憂愍。",
      "reading": "以姜桂與粱肉答太子勸食，臣自指鈞。",
      "note": "以姜桂與粱肉答太子勸食，臣自指鈞。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-yinjun-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 283,
      "end_codepoint": 313,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
